ther, Ayaka passed away in an accident during an excavation at an archaeological site. Midori, the family nanny married Mankai becoming his step mother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is usually blunt when talking, but he is kind at heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c113403"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c45170","characterName":"山咲 みどり","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c45170"},"originalCharacterName":"山咲 みどり","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"34"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"108"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"I"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shuuya's step mother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When it comes to sex, it is no exaggeration to say that she loves it. However, that does not mean that she has sex with just anyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She may seem easygoing and childish but being a former nanny, her housework skills are perfect, and at night she can be very erotic. She also has a strong maternal instinct, and when she sees someone in trouble, she can't leave them alone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c45170"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b93f03bea779fbc590417b41ffb54bf1e6165f3f3f9247878ab8d940a4d9c616.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1ee6ea2cc526c647703c0b07b17c950d19f523065bd4d57b69c9c5dbe